&lt;p&gt;You can get it at &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150414143031/http:/lichtspielhaus3d.com/"&gt;Lichtspielhaus3D.com&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150414143031/http:/http/www.myfonts.com/fonts/typocalypse/lichtspielhaus-handmade"&gt;Myfonts&lt;/a&gt; for a special introduction offer.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Out Now: LICHTSPIELHAUS. A TYPE NOIR.</title><link>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/116769/</link><pubDate>Fri, 23 May 2014 01:17:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/116769/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Lichtspielhaus&amp;rdquo; is a ultra condensed Lichtspiele Spin-Off with 8 weights. It still transports you back to a time where neon lights and marquee letters decorated cinema facades.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are 8 styles: Hairline, Thin, Light, Regular, Medium, Bold, Black and Heavy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Lichtspielhaus&amp;rdquo; is the first part of a new Type Noir Quadrilogy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can get it here if you like it:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150414144207/http:/www.myfonts.com/fonts/typocalypse/lichtspielhaus/"&gt;Lichtspielhaus at Myfonts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
or &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20150414144207/http:/lichtspielhaus3d.com/"&gt;Lichtspielhaus3D.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(80% OFF for a limited time)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20150414144207im_/http:/lichtspielhaus3d.com/img/showings/lichtspielhaus/jpg/small/00.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;
